      "tree": {
        "sha": "4d5a2458851733459c4c8498cdeff87e97622276",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/4d5a2458851733459c4c8498cdeff87e97622276"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 4d5a2458851733459c4c8498cdeff87e97622276\nparent 4519933391dd23dbf1a4eceec6dd53d2e9e71cc3\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1788549851 -0700\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1788553945 -0700\n\ntest: give Tor tests dedicated onion binds\n\nSeveral functional tests exercise Tor behavior without relying on a normal bind shared with the automatic onion service.\n\nConfigure dedicated onion binds for those scenarios. This prepares the tests for rejecting shared Tor binds.\n\nCo-authored-by: HouseOfHufflepuff <ahrens@gmail.com>\n",
